<title>CHINA: China's Zhejiang grain purchase exceeds target.</title>
<headline>China's Zhejiang grain purchase exceeds target.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's eastern province of Zhejiang had bought 1.95 million tonnes of grain at government-set prices from January 1 to December 15, the Xinhua Daily Telegraph said on Monday.</p>
<p>The amount exceeded the target for the whole year by 2.8 percent, the newspaper said.</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
</text>
